physical adsorption, precipitation, and the combined effects of these ­actions88. Adsorption mechanisms of ­Cd2+
and ­Cu2+ ions adsorption on the surface of CS@Fe-PA and MgO@Pp can be divided into two categories. The first
category refers to physical adsorption (physisorption), in which a one-step reaction mechanism occurs through

